      "filename": "Margam Abbey (St. Mary the Virgin) (18742590930).jpg",
      "title": "File:Margam Abbey (St. Mary the Virgin) (18742590930).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fe/Margam_Abbey_%28St._Mary_the_Virgin%29_%2818742590930%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Margam_Abbey_(St._Mary_the_Virgin)_(18742590930).jpg",
